{"unit_id":"swordordead__dsh-Veneer#card-zh","repo":"swordordead/dsh-Veneer","commit":"6d34f651d0aa06c514d253f5ec32bc965bb90c88","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Veneer 是面向 DSH 网页端的可视化主题编辑器，会在侧栏底部加入编辑入口，并打开可调整界面的浮动面板。用户可以修改多个界面的背景颜色与图片、图片位置和透明度，调整不同区域的字体与文字颜色，也能导入导出主题、应用内置样式模板。AI 主题页可调用 Harness 模型目录生成背景和字体方案，先预览再应用；主题通过 Host Settings 保存，并兼容浏览器本地快照。适合希望定制 DSH 外观的网页端用户；常规 AI 生成复用 Harness 已配置的模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:852-890","lib/client.js:2124-2265","lib/client.js:2893-2900","lib/theme-storage.js:162-223"]}
{"unit_id":"swordordead__dsh-Veneer#card-en","repo":"swordordead/dsh-Veneer","commit":"6d34f651d0aa06c514d253f5ec32bc965bb90c88","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Veneer adds a visual theme editor to the DSH web client. Users can adjust backgrounds, images, fonts, and colors, then import or export themes. AI generated styles can be previewed before applying. Theme settings persist through Host Settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:852-890","lib/client.js:2124-2265","lib/theme-storage.js:162-223"]}
