{"unit_id":"swordordead__dsh-Veneer#feature-1","repo":"swordordead/dsh-Veneer","commit":"6d34f651d0aa06c514d253f5ec32bc965bb90c88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Veneer 的功能「背景和图片编辑」：Veneer 的背景面板可调整界面背景色、图片、透明度与图片位置，并提供预览交互。 通过编辑面板操作，输入或选择界面样式，结果应用为主题设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2273-2315"]}
{"unit_id":"swordordead__dsh-Veneer#feature-2","repo":"swordordead/dsh-Veneer","commit":"6d34f651d0aa06c514d253f5ec32bc965bb90c88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Veneer 的功能「区域字体和文字颜色」：Veneer 可为不同界面区域设置字体与文字颜色，并支持从系统字体中选择或输入字体名。 通过编辑面板操作，输入或选择界面样式，结果应用为主题设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1322-1380"]}
{"unit_id":"swordordead__dsh-Veneer#feature-3","repo":"swordordead/dsh-Veneer","commit":"6d34f651d0aa06c514d253f5ec32bc965bb90c88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Veneer 的功能「主题导入导出」：Veneer 可将当前主题复制为 JSON 或下载为文件，也可选择 JSON 文件导入主题设置。 通过编辑面板操作，输入或选择界面样式，结果应用为主题设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1231-1260"]}
{"unit_id":"swordordead__dsh-Veneer#feature-4","repo":"swordordead/dsh-Veneer","commit":"6d34f651d0aa06c514d253f5ec32bc965bb90c88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Veneer 的功能「AI 主题生成」：Veneer 的 AI 主题页接受风格描述和模型选择，将生成结果先置于预览状态，用户确认后再应用。 通过编辑面板操作，输入或选择界面样式，结果应用为主题设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2124-2265"]}
{"unit_id":"swordordead__dsh-Veneer#feature-5","repo":"swordordead/dsh-Veneer","commit":"6d34f651d0aa06c514d253f5ec32bc965bb90c88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Veneer 的功能「主题保存和重置」：主题保存到 Host Settings，并维护 localStorage 快照；重置会清除快照和 Host 主题字段。通过编辑面板操作并保留当前主题设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/theme-storage.js:162-223"]}
